mention it); `ipok` is the instance for `C`. `rows`: the `hrow` of `E1PS.e1_sound`, from the facts of the classes of larger
dimension than the run's class 708 (`hhi`, the hypothesis of `RunHyp`, `Tab2/Induct.lean`) through `RT.rows_of_classes'`.
The slot facts are joined from the per-module range facts `rng_<first slot>` of `S<k>` (8 chunks of 512 slots each). -/

